	measure 'LE temp' = ```
			
			
			VAR _ActPercentTgt = SUM(Slide[LE])
			VAR _Factor = CALCULATE(DIVIDE(20,1), REMOVEFILTERS(Market))// Set the factor to the max value of the secondary Y-axis
			VAR _ScaledValue = IF(ISBLANK(_ActPercentTgt), BLANK(), _ActPercentTgt * _Factor)
			RETURN 
			   _ScaledValue  // Scale the result back to a percentage (0 to 1)
			
			```
