	measure 'S&OP BDGT (Multipled)' = ```
			
			Var __MinValue = MINX(ALL('AccessValues#2'[Access], 'AccessValues#2'[ColOrder]), [S&OP BDGT]) 
			Var __CurrentValue = [S&OP BDGT] 
			Var __Factor = 'Multiplication Factor'[Multiplication Factor Value]
			Var __Result = SWITCH(
			                        TRUE(),
			                        __CurrentValue > __MinValue * 9  , DIVIDE( __CurrentValue , __Factor * 0.75),
			                        __CurrentValue > __MinValue * 3, DIVIDE(__CurrentValue,  (__Factor/2) * 0.75 ),
			                        __CurrentValue
			) 
			RETURN __Result  
			```
		formatString: 0
		displayFolder: Tharun
		lineageTag: f2b40800-a831-49d7-98d5-5278c1ada7d5

