	measure 'Error Bar Reference Line' = ```
			
			Var __maxBdgt = MAXX(ALL('AccessValues#2'[Access], 'AccessValues#2'[ColOrder]), [S&OP BDGT (Multipled)])
			Var __maxM1 = MAXX(ALL('AccessValues#2'[Access], 'AccessValues#2'[ColOrder]), [S&OP M-1 (Multipled)])
			Var __maxm0 = MAXX(ALL('AccessValues#2'[Access], 'AccessValues#2'[ColOrder]), [S&OP Current (Multipled)])
			Var __maxLY = MAXX(ALL('AccessValues#2'[Access], 'AccessValues#2'[ColOrder]), [S&OP LY (Multipled)]) 
			Var __Max1 = IF(__maxBdgt > __maxM1, __maxBdgt, __maxM1)
			Var __Max2 = IF(__maxLY > __maxm0, __maxLY, __maxm0)
			Var __MaxValue = IF(__Max1> __Max2, __Max1, __Max2) + 10
			
			RETURN __MaxValue  
			```
		displayFolder: Tharun
		lineageTag: db849119-da1f-4b1b-b1a3-3705f384205c

