	measure 'Error Bar Data Label' = ```
			
			Var __Postive = format([M0AndM1Delta], REPT(UNICHAR(127),12)  & "0.00")   
			Var __negative  = format([M0AndM1Delta], REPT(UNICHAR(127),24)  & "(0.00)") 
			Var __IsPositive = [M0AndM1DeltaPlusrefPositive]
			Var __Result = IF(__IsPositive, __Postive, __negative)
			RETURN __Result 
			
			```
